h is the sweet spot; window-facing displays should be 3,500+ nits to beat direct sunlight. Send us your shopfront width and viewing distance and we'll recommend the exact size, pitch and brightness with a same-day quotation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you have a showroom in Dubai I can visit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — our Dubai showroom and demo facility lets you compare COB, MiP and SMD panels side by side at real viewing distances before you commit. Book a visit through the contact page and our team will prepare demos matched to your project type.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a permit for an LED sign in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Outdoor and shopfront LED signage in Dubai requires approval from Dubai Municipality and, for onshore trade signage, alignment with DED signboard guidelines. We prepare the technical drawings, brightness specifications and structural calculations your PRO needs for submission.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does LED wall installation take in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A standard indoor video wall is typically installed and commissioned within 3 to 7 working days once panels are on site. Larger builds like media facades or ballroom screens run 2 to 6 weeks including structural steel, cabling and calibration.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What after-sales support do you provide in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"All Dubai installations include a 2-year warranty with options to extend to 5 years, spare module stock held locally, and same-week on-site response. Remote monitoring can flag failed modules or power issues before they become visible on screen.\"}}]}9:X\ne:X\ne:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"04htY-RrK73KGsW60U1-n\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"legacy-page\",\"data-testid\":\"next-server-ren